{"game":"Memory of Goddess (NKS)","id":"coin-store","title":"Coin upgrades (EX)","group":"Upgrades","summary":"EX Edition only: permanent stat slots bought with Coins, plus paid revives and rerolls.","sections":[{"type":"text","text":"You can set random attributes for 4 slots or use Coins to enhance each slot.\n\nEnhanced slots will retain their upgrades and not be reset even if you perform a reset.\nA reset (re-rolling the attributes) costs 10,000 Coins; locking a slot so it keeps its attribute adds 5,000 to that cost."},{"type":"table","title":"Slot enhancement costs","note":"The same for all 4 slots.","columns":[{"label":"Grade","num":true},{"label":"Coins","num":true}],"rows":[[1,10000],[2,15000],[3,25000],[4,35000],[5,45000],[6,55000],[7,65000],[8,75000],[9,85000],[10,100000]]},{"type":"table","title":"Possible attributes","note":"Chance: how likely a reset gives this attribute. Each attribute comes in an A and a rarer, stronger S version; the value grows with the slot’s grade.","columns":["Attribute",{"label":"Chance","num":true},{"label":"Grade 1","num":true},{"label":"Grade 5","num":true},{"label":"Grade 10","num":true}],"rows":[[{"img":"icn_nks_attack","caption":"ATK A","size":"small"},"6.5%","+1","+3","+6"],[{"img":"icn_nks_attack","caption":"ATK S","size":"small"},"1.5%","+1","+5","+12"],[{"img":"icn_nks_attackspeed","caption":"Attack Speed A","size":"small"},"3.5%","+5%","+17%","+35%"],[{"img":"icn_nks_attackspeed","caption":"Attack Speed S","size":"small"},"1.5%","+5%","+25%","+50%"],[{"img":"icn_nks_projspeed","caption":"Projectile Speed A","size":"small"},"8.5%","+5%","+17%","+35%"],[{"img":"icn_nks_projspeed","caption":"Projectile Speed S","size":"small"},"3%","+5%","+25%","+50%"],[{"img":"icn_nks_hp","caption":"Maximum HP A","size":"small"},"20%","+10","+50","+100"],[{"img":"icn_nks_hp","caption":"Maximum HP S","size":"small"},"8.5%","+10","+90","+200"],[{"img":"icn_nks_maxrevivecount","caption":"Maximum Revivals A","size":"small"},"1.5%","+1","+1",